From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Vlad Panazan <git@praznet.com>
Date: Tue, 1 Sep 2026 11:20:29 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 14/14] hwui: remove duplicate Bitmap::compress declaration

The fenced host-HWUI patch 0009 carries a rebase resolution that declares
the static Bitmap::compress overload twice. Keep that host integration patch
unchanged and apply this required corrective follow-up so Bitmap.h has the
single stock-compatible declaration expected by the C++ compiler.

---
 libs/hwui/hwui/Bitmap.h | 3 ---
 1 file changed, 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/libs/hwui/hwui/Bitmap.h b/libs/hwui/hwui/Bitmap.h
index 902c246cf..f453a13a9 100644
--- a/libs/hwui/hwui/Bitmap.h
+++ b/libs/hwui/hwui/Bitmap.h
@@ -184,9 +184,6 @@ public:
     static bool compress(const SkBitmap& bitmap, JavaCompressFormat format, int32_t quality,
                          SkWStream* stream);
 
-  static bool compress(const SkBitmap& bitmap, JavaCompressFormat format,
-                       int32_t quality, SkWStream* stream);
-
     static constexpr uint64_t UNDEFINED_BITMAP_ID = 0u;
 private:
     static sk_sp<Bitmap> allocateAshmemBitmap(size_t size, const SkImageInfo& i, size_t rowBytes);
